      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a npcx specific issue,  that is, turning off the pwm when setting duty cycle zero and relying on pwm_get_enabled() for determining if the fan is enabled. I think it needs to be solved in the npcx-specific code to have the fan_get/set_enable API make sense.",
